---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
import { formatPrice } from '../lib/catalog';

const { shipping, returns } = site;
---

<Page
  title="Shipping and returns"
  eyebrow="Help"
  description={`How Simone Chagoya Studio ships orders from ${site.city}, and how returns work.`}
>
  <p class="lede" slot="lede">Everything ships from the studio in {site.city}.</p>

  <h2>Shipping</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Ready-to-ship pieces leave the studio in {shipping.processing}.</li>
    <li>
      Standard US shipping is {formatPrice(shipping.standardRate)}{shipping.freeThreshold > 0 && `, and complimentary on orders over ${formatPrice(shipping.freeThreshold)}`}.
      It usually arrives 4 to 8 business days after your order.
    </li>
    <li>Express shipping is {formatPrice(shipping.expressRate)} and usually arrives in 2 to 4 business days.</li>
    <li>Every order ships with tracking. You will get the number by email as soon as it leaves.</li>
    <li>Made-to-order pieces and commissions have their own timelines, agreed with you before work starts.</li>
    <li>Right now the shop ships within the United States. For international orders, <a href="/commissions">get in touch</a>.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Original paintings</h2>
  <p>
    Originals are packed and shipped by a specialist art shipper, fully insured. Shipping is quoted separately when you
    inquire, and local pickup in Chicago is welcome.
  </p>

  <h2>Returns</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Ready-to-ship necklaces, prints and cards can be returned within {returns.days} days of delivery for a full refund of the item price.</li>
    <li>Pieces need to come back unworn and in their original packaging.</li>
    <li>Custom, personalized and made-to-order pieces are final sale.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    To start a return, email <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> with your order number. Refunds go back to
    the original payment method within a few days of the piece arriving back at the studio.
  </p>

  <h2>Something wrong?</h2>
  <p>
    If anything arrives damaged, email a photo within 7 days and Simone will repair or replace it.
  </p>
</Page>
